      "writtenOn": "2017-01-03T21:11:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "there *is* a vendor command to confirm TPM version and erase the old RW. What\u0027s missing is a decision when to send that vendor command: crosbug.com/p/55667 (it would be great if you could comment on that too, Darren).\n \nOnce that is settled, this code path will be removed, it is not a subject of this patch.\n\nWe could send the vendor command to re-enable commits at the same time.\n\nI would rather avoid sending a \"stop commits\" vendor command to on every single TPM reset: it is a waste of time for this particular application.\n\nWe control both sides, we might as well benefit from it and have this system-dependent default behavior.",
